arxa-designer — license scope

This skill contains two layers with different licenses:

1. Upstream-derived portions. The skill was originally forked from
   `kimi-design`, a Kimi-Code port of https://github.com/JimLiu/baoyu-design
   (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Jim Liu 宝玉), itself an independent community
   repackaging of a hosted design product's skill. For those derived
   portions the original MIT notice below is preserved, as its terms
   require.

2. Everything else. All Totem Labs additions and modifications — including
   the viewport ladder, the authored-structure contract, the design
   methodology, ADRs, runtime, references, and every change made since the
   fork — are proprietary under the repository root LICENSE
   (Copyright (c) 2026 Totem Labs, all rights reserved) and are NOT offered
   under the MIT license.

